BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:75b0658706a43212c9b8e254aa2b2b64cbffe241@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261128T153847Z
DTSTART:20270101T010000Z
DTEND:20270101T030000Z
SUMMARY:Ward Hayden & The Outliers NYE
LOCATION:Lizard Lounge\, 1667 Massachusetts Ave\, Cambridge\, MA 02138
DESCRIPTION:Ward Hayden & The Outliers ring in the new year with their cele
 bration of the life\, legacy and music of Hank Williams Boston is one of A
 merica’s great music towns. But among the various styles the city is kno
 wn for that have launched many musical acts to success and stardom\, count
 ry music wasn’t a truly thriving genre there\, that’s until singer\, s
 ongwriter and guitarist Ward Hayden and his band The Outliers (formerly kn
 own as Girls Guns & Glory) sang and played their distinctive take on C&W w
 ith a rock’n’roll kick to the top of the Boston scene and a thriving\,
  critically-acclaimed and highly-awarded career across America and in Euro
 pe.Beginning in 2010 Ward and his collection of bandmates & musician frien
 ds began gathering together on Jan 1st to kick off every new year and hono
 r the life and legacy of one of their biggest musical influences: HankWill
 iams.HankWilliams lived for just 29 short years\, but what a lasting and m
 eaningful legacy he left behind.Hank left this world on Jan 1\, 1953 and e
 very year Ward has assembled an incredible collection of songs from Hank
 ’s catalog\, with new surprises\, country classics\, & deep cuts added e
 very single year.In addition to performing a full set of Hank’s music\, 
 each year the band also performs a set of Ward Hayden & the Outliers origi
 nal songs.For fans of Hank\, fans of Country Music\, & fans of Ward & the 
 Outliers\, it doesn’t get much better than this. And it’s a rare chanc
 e to catch the band in the intimate environment of the Lizard Lounge\, a v
 enue in which the band has really cut their teeth & where they have return
 ed to every year for this very special & unique show. Join us this year fo
 r Ward Hayden & the Outliers 18th Annual Celebration of Hank Williams at t
 he Lizard Lounge.\nhttps://lizardloungeclub.com/event/ward-hayden-the-outl
 iers-nye/\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://lizardloungeclub.com/event/ward-hayden-the-outliers-nye/
END:VEVENT
